Cheddar demonstration survey (one branch of it)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
server/tests/SilexGis.Api.Tests/Fixtures/Cheddar-Whitebeam.lox — one branch of the
compiled Therion model the CaveView.js project publishes as its Cheddar
demonstration survey: nine surveys and their two ancestors, the stations belonging
to them and the legs between those stations, read with the format's own reader and
written back out with its own writer. Nothing else was edited; it is 38 kB of a
9 MB file. Test fixture only: nothing here is built into a shipped artifact.

  Source:    https://github.com/aardgoose/CaveView.js (docs/surveys/Cheddar.lox)
  License:   MIT (c) 2016 aardgoose — the repository's licence; it states no
             separate terms for its demonstration surveys
  The cave:  the source names no surveyor and no register entry for the data in
             this file.
  Checksum:  sha256 898b4c198eba42980e21ef3be319b1dede24e6579fee3bc9dd39f8dc6c8d5da7

